---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import NeuralLab from '../components/NeuralLab.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Arkein AI Playground — Autonomous Personal Agent & Neural Core"
  description="Konsol dialog mandiri dengan representasi cerdas Arkana Ravenno. Didukung oleh integrasi 9Router lokal dengan memori multi-turn, penalaran adaptif, dan inferensi real-time."
>
  <main class="relative z-10 pt-28 pb-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-7xl mx-auto space-y-12">
    
    <!-- Top Return & Breadcrumb Bar -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 pb-4 font-mono text-xs">
      <a 
        href="/" 
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-arctic-cobalt/20 border border-white/10 hover:border-arctic-cobalt/50 text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-all group"
      >
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18" />
        </svg>
        <span>Kembali ke Portofolio Utama</span>
      </a>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-slate-400">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        <span class="text-slate-300 font-semibold">STANDALONE CONSOLE</span>
        <span class="text-slate-600">//</span>
        <span class="text-arctic-cobalt">ROUTE: /playground</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Playground Stage (Split Grid for Desktop) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
      
      <!-- Primary Neural Console (8 Columns on Desktop) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-8">
        <NeuralLab />
      </div>

      <!-- Agent Inspector & Telemetry Sidebar (4 Columns on Desktop) -->
      <aside class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-6">
        
        <!-- Sidebar Card 1: Dual AI Gateway Info (Cloud & Local) -->
        <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-2xl border-white/10 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-arctic-cobalt font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-arctic-cobalt animate-ping"></span>
              DUAL AI GATEWAY ARCHITECTURE
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 font-bold">
              CLOUD & LOKAL
            </span>
          </div>

          <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Arsitektur playground ini siap digunakan baik saat pengembangan lokal maupun saat di-hosting online 24/7 ke publik.
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-2 font-mono text-[11px] bg-void-950/80 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
            <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-400">
              <span>Cloud 24/7:</span>
              <span class="text-sky-300 font-semibold">OpenRouter AI</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-400">
              <span>Local Dev:</span>
              <span class="text-emerald-400">9Router (Port 20128)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-400">
              <span>Memory:</span>
              <span class="text-white font-semibold">Multi-Turn Stateful</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-slate-400">
              <span>Zero-Crash:</span>
              <span class="text-amber-300">Local Persona Core</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 pt-1 font-mono text-xs">
            <a 
              href="https://openrouter.ai/keys" 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer" 
              class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 py-2 px-2.5 rounded-xl bg-void-900 border border-arctic-cobalt/40 text-arctic-cobalt hover:bg-arctic-cobalt hover:text-void-950 text-[11px] font-semibold transition-all text-center"
            >
              <span>OpenRouter Keys</span>
              <svg class="w-3 h-3 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" /></svg>
            </a>
            <a 
              href="http://localhost:20128/dashboard" 
              target="_blank" 
              rel="noopener noreferrer" 
              class="flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 py-2 px-2.5 rounded-xl bg-void-900 border border-white/10 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:border-emerald-400/50 text-[11px] font-semibold transition-all text-center"
            >
              <span>9Router Lokal</span>
              <svg class="w-3 h-3 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14" /></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar Card 2: Fair Usage & Token Longevity Defense -->
        <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-2xl border-white/10 space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-3">
            <span class="text-amber-300 font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
              FAIR USAGE & DEFENSE SYSTEM
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">ANTI-EXHAUSTION</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2.5 text-[11px] text-slate-300 font-sans">
            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-void-950/60 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
              <div class="font-semibold text-white font-mono flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="text-sky-400">01.</span>
                <span>Session Quota Guard (10 Credits/Hari)</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
                Mencegah bot atau crawler menghabiskan token kuota publik dengan pembatasan otomatis berbasis hari.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-void-950/60 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
              <div class="font-semibold text-white font-mono flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="text-emerald-400">02.</span>
                <span>Bring Your Own Key (BYOK Unlimited)</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
                Pengunjung atau recruiter dapat memasukkan API Key pribadi di menu Settings untuk akses tanpa batas.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-void-950/60 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
              <div class="font-semibold text-white font-mono flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="text-amber-400">03.</span>
                <span>Smart 429 Rotation & Fallback</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
                Jika model gratis terkena rate limit (HTTP 429), sistem otomatis memutar model cadangan atau beralih ke Local Core tanpa crash.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar Card 3: Agent Capabilities & Digital Twin Profile -->
        <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-2xl border-white/10 space-y-4">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 pb-3">
            <span class="font-mono text-xs text-sky-frost font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-frost"></span>
              DIGITAL TWIN CAPABILITIES
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-400">ARKANA AI</span>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-void-950/60 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
              <div class="font-semibold text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="text-arctic-cobalt">#</span>
                <span>Arsitektur Sistem Logistik DrivePass</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Tanyakan skema Prisma PostgreSQL, Distance Matrix Service, dan optimasi latensi &lt;100ms.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-void-950/60 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
              <div class="font-semibold text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="text-sky-frost">#</span>
                <span>Teknologi Web Portofolio Arkein</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Astro 5 Island Architecture, Tailwind CSS v4, dan animasi kinetik GSAP hardware-accelerated 60 FPS.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-void-950/60 border border-white/5 space-y-1">
              <div class="font-semibold text-white flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="text-emerald-400">#</span>
                <span>Filosofi Rekayasa & Standar Kualitas</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Prinsip sistem deterministik, metrik terverifikasi, dan estetika visual modern.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar Card 4: Multi-turn Interaction Guide -->
        <div class="glass-panel p-5 rounded-2xl border-white/10 space-y-3 font-mono text-xs">
          <div class="text-slate-200 font-semibold flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
            <span>TIPS INTERAKSI AGENTIC</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
            Karena AI ini memiliki <strong>Context Retention</strong>, Anda tidak perlu mengulang konteks di setiap giliran. Anda dapat bertanya secara bertahap seperti:
          </p>
          <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-void-900 border border-white/5 space-y-1 text-[10.5px] text-sky-200">
            <div>1. "Apa peran Arkana di proyek DrivePass?"</div>
            <div>2. "Lalu teknologi apa yang dipakai untuk backend-nya?"</div>
            <div>3. "Kenapa memilih Prisma dibanding ORM lain?"</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>

  </main>
</Layout>
